<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">Prepare Before You Act: 
<br class="ltx_break">Learning From Humans to Rearrange Initial States
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yinlong Dai
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
